{"id":35070,"shortDescription":"¡Clementine Valley solía ser el lugar ideal! Era reconocido mundialmente por sus fantásticos árboles frutales cuidados cariñosamente por el viejo Jim. Por desgracia, Jim se ha quedado sin fuerzas para cultivar la fruta suficiente como para mantener feliz a la gente del lugar y atraer los turistas que Clementine Valley solía tener.","developers":["Honeyslug"],"publishers":["Square Enix"],"categories":["Un jugador","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"1 OCT 2009","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/35070?t=1709895489","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_da3815b325aeb512aaccfe017445e8e3e5cb49e2.600x338.jpg?t=1709895489","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_da3815b325aeb512aaccfe017445e8e3e5cb49e2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709895489"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_0eba31a32fd0598f2dbc19818e90548d309cd8ca.600x338.jpg?t=1709895489","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_0eba31a32fd0598f2dbc19818e90548d309cd8ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709895489"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_76cd3f97354b3830e162c8062dd8522edd7708a5.600x338.jpg?t=1709895489","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_76cd3f97354b3830e162c8062dd8522edd7708a5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709895489"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_5fb02cf58e7526996ad72c4cb8dc3d72fc81000c.600x338.jpg?t=1709895489","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_5fb02cf58e7526996ad72c4cb8dc3d72fc81000c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709895489"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35070/ss_d389a19053cfa90dc226d8384ad0c05e6b4debf2.600x338.jpg?t=1709895489","f